  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's look at Andrea and Jean Reno talking at the cafe step by step.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "Un pastis, s'il vous plaît!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'A pastis, please!' Jean orders an aniseed aperitif from the cafe waiter.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Mais Jean, il est dix heures.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Oh but Jean, it is ten in the morning.' Andrea reminds the actor of the early hour.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "Oui, mais on doit parler.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, but we have to talk.' Jean emphasizes that they have an important matter to discuss.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Pourquoi boire si tôt le matin?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why drink so early in the morning?' Andrea inquires why he is drinking liquor before noon.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "Il faut être à égalité.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We must be on equal footing.' Jean argues that they should share equal conditions for their talk.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Tu en es à combien?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'How many have you had?' Andrea asks how many drinks he has already consumed.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "C'est seulement le deuxième verre.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is only my second glass.' Jean downplays the amount he has had to drink.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Ça ne te ressemble pas du tout.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That is not like you at all.' Andrea remarks that heavy morning drinking is out of character for him.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "J'avais besoin d'éclaircir mes idées.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I needed to clear my thoughts.' Jean confides that his mind felt foggy and overburdened.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Tu as un problème grave?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do you have a serious problem?' Andrea probes whether some major crisis has occurred.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "Je suis fatigué de ce métier.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am tired of this profession.' Jean confesses his growing exhaustion with the film industry.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Tu dois rester calme, Jean.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You must stay calm, Jean.' Andrea advises him to maintain his composure.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "jean",
   "t": "Remettez-m'en un, s'il vous plaît.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Pour me another one, please.' Jean signals the waiter to bring another round.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Non, écoute-moi d'abord, Jean.",
   "gap": 0.55
